  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_ex03_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_ex03",
  "title": "采访环节",
  "storyCode": "OF-EX3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "848ac2da36fc7b8df78366e876b3bfda2558190f20212a2f959194003a6832bf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "刚才是不是地震了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "对啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "毕竟我们离舞台这么近哎！看到了吗！？你看到D.D.D.的表情了吗！？她是怎么做到的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "她已经下台了啦，你不要老是这么......等等，这不是又在震了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "哎呀，说不定是低音炮的缘故......慢着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "哎...哎？你也察觉到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "......快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "什、什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "别问那么多了，快跟我走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "text": "不要挤啊！离我远点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "text": "你踩着我的脚了！！滚开啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "text": "有人晕倒了！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "怎、怎么突然都躁动起来，难道真的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "......我的天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "......是大帝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "嗯哼，天气不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（欢呼声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "大帝！是真人！！啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "text": "别蠢了！这都什么时候了，你竟然还在意地震！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "不，只是，看见大帝，等等，我有点，喘不过气......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "大帝先生，这边请。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "各位观众！请退后！退至线后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，那个萨弗拉年轻人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "没关系，让他们靠近点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "可是大帝先生，您一会还有演出，如果出了什么意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "意外？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "枪击，刺杀，绑架，自杀威胁，意外是指这些东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "这些东西能阻止什么？阻止我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不，它们会变成我舞台的一部分，就像语言的意义被节奏消解，你明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "不、不明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "简单来说就是节目效果。放轻松，塞壬唱片绝对不会追究你们失责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（欢呼声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "text": "大帝！！大帝！！大帝！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喔，总算来了，快，不要紧张，放轻松，大胆点，相信你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "什么西哥伦比亚的说唱之神，你，你就是个痞子，一个走狗屎运的幸运儿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "大声点，伙计，大声说话！喂，萨弗拉人，不要赶他走，把麦克风给他。不要慌，这里听我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "你毁了我们的生活，你却坐拥那么多产业，你......你该去死！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "text": "咿呀——他拔出了一把弩！快躲开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "不怪我，对，都是你的错，你所谓的说唱帝国建立在多少歌手的牺牲之下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "什么大帝啊，吃屎去吧，你这只下作的企鹅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊哈，让我想想，到底是谁在耍一些不入流的小手段？媒体，舆论，人身攻击，还有枪杀，哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "你以为在下水道和垃圾堆里打一圈滚我就认不出你了吗？对那些年轻人开枪让你满足吗，“歌手”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "如果不是我恰好有那么点看不顺眼，你们又会继续“排除”掉多少不合口味的新星。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "然后把捞来的钞票堆在自己的澡盆里，唾弃着整个哥伦比亚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "闭嘴！给我去死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "快保护大帝先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "大帝先生中弹了，快......欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "开枪的是大帝先生？那家伙的弩被打飞了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "哒哒哒哒哒，哒！砰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "真奇怪。同你废话了这么多，枪口冒烟的人怎么是我？猜猜看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "是因为你太没种，还是我光芒万丈，你睁不开眼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "咕——呃——你随身带着铳械......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "如果一个人每天多死个几次，就会养成随身携带武器的好习惯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的游客",
      "text": "咳咳——你以为，只有我一个人吗？想想你过去招惹的敌人，你走不出这座汐斯塔市的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "我的过去比这边虚假的海洋还要宽广，你说的敌人又在哪个犄角旮旯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "大帝先生！观众里面混着很多他们的同伙，我们处理不过来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "行了，不要这么慌张。你们就维护好现场的秩序，剩下的交给专业人士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "比如我的，企鹅物流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "......我怎么记得我们是来度假的？姑且问一下，有加班费吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "在旅店呆了这么久，的确可以适当运动一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "因为德克萨......因为“空”你一直待在宾馆里看书嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......好像是还有这个约定。战斗的时候反应得过来吗，德克萨斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "没问题！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "老板，这里完工了，要帮我订明天最前排的套票哟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "大帝先生，这、这些人是怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "就当我们是老板......是大帝先生的私人保镖吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "虽然我们是个物流公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "本来我们的业务扩展就很丰富嘛。之前不是还买了一家爵士乐酒吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "还有那些总是被当成沙包的叙拉古黑帮，不过最近安分得有些诡异。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "你以为我们每个月要在龙门打多少次架？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "论斗殴和火并，我们才是行家里手，最顶级的，无人能及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的观众",
      "text": "老子等这一刻好久了！西边的企鹅！你既然敢光明正大地出现，就等死吧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "......你们是成立了一个贼喊捉贼协会吗？好吧，反正也和我想的差不太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "德克萨斯，动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "明白——啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "——明白了！我上了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
